<title>USA: ValliCorp terminates merger talks.</title>
<headline>ValliCorp terminates merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValliCorp Holdings Inc said on Wednesday that it has terminated the preliminary merger talks it had announced with another bank holding company.</p>
<p>ValliCorp representatives were not immediately available for comment. The name of the other bank holding company was not disclosed.</p>
<p>ValliCorp Holdings said its board is continuing to evaluate all of its options, which include remaining independent.</p>
